        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Production of precast geopolymer concrete pipe, using industrial machinery. Based on information provided by Röser GmbH, Steißlingen, Germany\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset represents the production of 1 m³ of precast geopolymer concrete pipe in Germany.\nThe dataset includes all waste treatment processes arising from the production phase at the precast plant.\nThe end-of-life treatment of the pipe itself (e.g., demolition, recycling, disposal) is not included and must be accounted for in downstream processes that use this dataset as an input.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
